之自息。愚心勤勤，每执斯旨；故诞屈其所是，默以见从；此之为愆，实由于畴。谨不敢逃死，归罪有司；唯乞天鉴，特垂清察","attribution":"裴注·会稽邵氏家传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef864cd2428ef2e1604a","start":103,"end":283,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-b3c110ad169eb0235d32","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-7b5fb27370763053e3fa","layer":"pei","quote":"邵畴字温伯。时为诞功曹。诞被收，惶遽无以自明。畴进曰：‘畴今自在，畴之事，明府何忧？’遂诣吏自列，云不白妖言，事由于己，非府君罪","attribution":"裴注·会稽邵氏家传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef864cd2428ef2e1604a","start":14,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
